<div class="WordSection1">
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-language:JA">No preference on my side, Anthony. Please let me know if you would like to use City Hall, we can reserve a conference room for you.
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
