</div>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">Yes, I just let Axon know that we have 2 council members confirmed for tomorrow. They will be here for the duration of the time you sent and we will hopefully get a couple more council members to attend. Let me work on the location. Martin
