<p class="xxmsonormal" style="margin:0in"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Good morning, City Council (Bcc&#8217;d),</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="xxmsonormal" style="margin:0in"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="xxmsonormal" style="margin:0in"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">A gentle reminder, PD is looking to coordinate a briefing tomorrow and the following Tuesday; if you can kindly respond to confirm your availability this will greatly assist with scheduling.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="xxmsonormal" style="margin:0in"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="xxmsonormal" style="margin:0in"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Thank you,</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="xxmsonormal" style="margin:0in"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Martin</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="xxmsonormal" style="margin:0in"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<div style="border:none;border-top:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in;border-color:currentcolor currentcolor">
<p class="xxmsonormal" style="margin:0in"><b><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">From:</span></b><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"> Martin McTaggart<br>
<b>Sent:</b> Thursday, August 20, 2026 4:36 PM<br>
<b>Cc:</b> Ed Barberini &lt;<a href="mailto:ebarberini@cityofsanmateo.org">ebarberini@cityofsanmateo.org</a>&gt;; Anthony Riccardi &lt;<a href="mailto:ARiccardi@cityofsanmateo.org">ARiccardi@cityofsanmateo.org</a>&gt;; Alex Khojikian &lt;<a href="mailto:akhojikian@cityofsanmateo.org">akhojikian@cityofsanmateo.org</a>&gt;<br>
<b>Subject:</b> Council Poll: Axon Technology Briefing Availability<br>
<b>Importance:</b> High</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<p class="xxmsonormal" style="margin:0in">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="xxmsonormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:0in">
<span style="font-size:11.0pt">Good afternoon, City Council (Bcc&#8217;d),</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="xxmsonormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:0in">
<span style="font-size:11.0pt">The Police Department is exploring additional technology solutions available through Axon that could support the City&#8217;s public safety operations. As part of that exploration, Axon has offered to provide Council members with an
 IN PERSON informational briefing and demonstration of its technology.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="xxmsonormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:0in">
<span style="font-size:11.0pt">The briefing will focus primarily on Axon&#8217;s Automated License Plate Recognition (ALPR) technology, including its Outpost fixed license plate reader and video solution. Axon will also provide an overview of other public safety
 technology, including Dedrone airspace security, as well as information regarding data security and privacy, ethical oversight, potential contract scope, and financial considerations.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="xxmsonormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:0in">
<b><span style="font-size:11.0pt">The purpose of this briefing is informational only.</span></b><span style="font-size:11.0pt"> It is intended to provide Council members with an opportunity to learn more about the technology and ask questions directly of Axon
 representatives. Participation does not represent a commitment by the City to purchase or implement any particular product.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="xxmsonormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:0in">
<span style="font-size:11.0pt">To accommodate Council schedules and allow for a more conversational presentation and Q&amp;A, Axon has proposed several identical one-hour small-group sessions (maximum of two Council Members per session).</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="xxmsonormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:0in">
<b><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Please reply to me at your earliest opportunity and indicate ALL of the time slots below that you would be available to attend.</span></b><span style="font-size:11.0pt"> We will use the responses to coordinate the sessions.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="xxmsonormal" style="margin:0in"><b><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Tuesday, August 25:</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>
<ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc">
<li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">1:00&#8211;2:00 p.m.</span><o:p></o:p></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">2:00&#8211;3:00 p.m.</span><o:p></o:p></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">3:00&#8211;4:00 p.m.</span><o:p></o:p></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">4:00&#8211;5:00 p.m.</span><o:p></o:p></li></ul>
<p class="xxmsonormal" style="margin:0in"><b><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Tuesday, September 1:</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>
<ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc">
<li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l2 level1 lfo6"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">1:00&#8211;2:00 p.m.</span><o:p></o:p></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l2 level1 lfo6"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">2:00&#8211;3:00 p.m.</span><o:p></o:p></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l2 level1 lfo6"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">3:00&#8211;4:00 p.m.</span><o:p></o:p></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo6"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">4:00&#8211;5:00 p.m.</span><o:p></o:p></li></ul>
<p class="xxmsonormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:0in">
<span style="font-size:11.0pt">Thank you, and please let me know if you have any questions.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="xxmsonormal" style="margin:0in"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Best wishes,</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="xxmsonormal" style="margin:0in"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Martin</span><o:p></o:p></p>
